Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)为了打倒九十九游马和星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然把基拉古送到了人类世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然那家伙还是担不起重任吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 阿里特在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)干嘛啊 多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 我命令你去回收 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在立刻去人类的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么是我啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在他们的世界里没法认真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么无聊的工作我可敬谢不敏。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知 知道了啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去就行了吧 去就行了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都是为了异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了 阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.07,0:01:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)交给阿里特真的好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不打败九十九游马把 No.卡回收的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.73,0:01:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们巴利安就没有明天。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然交给那种单细胞……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.49,0:01:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，别这么说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别的先不说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}论决斗的本事阿里特是可以信任的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.31,0:01:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}稍微观察一下情况也没什么不好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～ 还挺有两下子的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(沙奈蛾)决斗偶像 蝶野沙奈蛾。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[屏幕]『用炽热的指尖抽卡』。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[屏幕]现在 好评发售中。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你的心 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 是吗原来叫早苗酱啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真可爱呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看起来玩得挺开心嘛。嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你是谁啊你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.73,0:04:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.59,0:04:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊这是第一次用这副模样跟你见面吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别给我说些莫名其妙的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个十字计数器。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙是阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明一直失败看到可爱小姑娘就{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}色眯眯地凑上去你可真悠闲啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那是碰巧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}管你碰巧还是什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被女人分了心这种事都说了那是搞错了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 你这家伙就没有那种事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎样男人就是要决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我除了决斗以外 什么都不感兴趣！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被女人夺走心神什么的绝对 不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 不过要是眼前真有天使
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临下来的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就另当别论了。哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能用真正的姿态来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗这事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真麻烦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过嘛 用这副模样就算在决斗中赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也没法回收 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以也没办法吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.93,0:05:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 危险……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对 对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天……天使。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有、有天使在。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}牛奶蛋糕。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，基拉格……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道爱是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.35,0:06:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的面前有天使降临了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉格啊，我啊，一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把天使的心给拿下给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我的反击战法。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，真的是个笨蛋呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你，是昨天的……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候真是失礼了。作为赔礼请收下这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.59,0:07:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《首先用轻轻的刺拳来接近》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.91,0:07:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用啦，道歉什么的……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《立刻用杀手锏回击》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)让开 让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.82,0:07:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)吃我一记猛冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！很危险啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉 抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站住 铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)请等一下！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～！小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《首先是一记有冲击力的先制拳》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在干什么啊！？很危险的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《装作挨了对方的拳头……》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《慌慌张张跑过来的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用反击技…》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个罪孽深重的大小姐啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光顾着看太过美丽的你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一不小心踩空了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讨厌啦 怎么会…))
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一招来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了！ 上吧 真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个 是你掉的东西哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 又不是我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《好！ 趁现在 赶紧…》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((失礼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还以为是从你背上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}长出的天使翅膀上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掉下来的呢))
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 好恶心啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉 抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看你那样子好像不太顺利啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不太清楚怎么回事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但有个莫名其妙老是来捣乱的家伙在啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都怪那家伙，我的反击战术全泡汤了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是恋爱竞争对手吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就告诉你一件好事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(闪闪)听好了，女人这种生物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是喜欢强大的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果有竞争对手的话就把那家伙打趴下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你很强这件事好好展示给她看啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把竞争对手打趴下…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恋爱的秘诀就是赢过对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢 要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒他…原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？这是什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…“挑战书”？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是挑战书呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么时候的事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这是为你好。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以小鸟为赌注的男人与男人之间的认真决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么怎么回事不就是字面意思吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要在决斗中打倒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要跟我决斗夹着尾巴逃跑吗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要选哪个？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么理由 我既然被
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挑战了决斗 怎么可能逃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR视野 链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.79,0:12:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻是我 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.73,0:12:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《以现在这副模样 我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是无法使用混沌之力的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤 燃烧骷髅头 头盖骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 选手入场宣告。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将冠有燃烧骷髅头之名的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这边 燃烧骷髅头 玻璃乔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把等级４的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手 护头拳士和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手 草鞋拳士进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:13:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将潜藏于灵魂的火焰寄宿于拳中。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手 拘束蛮兵 刺拳拳手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一上来就超量召唤吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）小心点，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从他身上感受到某种非同寻常的压力。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定又是异晶人的刺客。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那是……那是星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自星光体世界的使者。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，那家伙是。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放两张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这家伙变得越来越有意思了啊》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤我我我魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动魔法卡破天荒之风。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来我让我我我魔术师的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1,000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 我我我魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击利德布罗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那招太天真了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动利德布罗的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效战斗造成的破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 伤害你还是得吃下。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还算不错的拳头。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.52,0:14:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 利德布洛的更进一步效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当超量素材减少时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升800点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不仅不会被战斗破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力还会上升吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动永续魔法时间战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在怪兽之间的战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家造成伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再追加1,000点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给与你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利德布洛 嘎嘎嘎魔女和时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.98,0:15:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才吃下的伤害五倍奉还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？我这反击的滋味。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，挺有效的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏如此，终于{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变得有意思起来了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？我这就回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤怒怒怒战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽可以通过将攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降500点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无需解放即可召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此外，我从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死者苏生。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.16,0:16:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧，我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将等级从1到8{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变更为任意等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将我我我魔术师的等级变更为6。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，用等级6的怒怒怒战士和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绷紧炽热的灵魂，瞄准吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.71,0:16:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加特林·射手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动加特林·射手的怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的1只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然来这一手也太赖了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为我会这么惊讶吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 超量·格挡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在对方的怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:16:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.19,0:17:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从自己场上的怪兽超量素材中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1个超量素材取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使那个效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利刃龙使用了超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利刃龙会随着超量单位的减少
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而变强。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3,800！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.99,0:17:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越是受到攻击就越强吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.73,0:17:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多该让我给你最后一击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用利刃龙攻击加特林射手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解除束缚，放出灼热之拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动，战斗突袭！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因攻击造成的破坏无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将这场战斗中对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:17:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家造成的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原封不动地给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就等你这一手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是不这么打过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的反击可就定不下来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 加速·步法 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手的陷阱发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其无效并破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧，交叉反击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来游马受到的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加上时间战斗的效果，是2400。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总算是勉强留下100点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，游马！那张卡是……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心·交叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在对手的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动时才能发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽1张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那是怪兽，在战斗期间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将双方怪兽的攻击力互换{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将对方怪兽的攻击力变成零！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.54,0:18:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 抽到怪兽以外的卡时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己受到的伤害会翻倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怕失败怕成那样 还想赢那家伙吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾吧！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.43,0:19:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！ 是怪兽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}枪管射手 双十字计数器！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈 太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是速攻魔法 燃烧拳击手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡在名为
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用战斗破坏对方怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予那个怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果 游马那时候 如果害怕风险{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对发动异热同心犹豫不决的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会被凯欧终结之拳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追击而败北。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马那鲁莽的赌注。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 是无论身处何等困境都相信希望的心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以毫厘之差让他抓住了胜利吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.69,0:20:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了 成功了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 你怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以为是为你着想才一直没说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但果然还是应该
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.94,0:20:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟小鸟小姐说一声{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以为是为你着想。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从真月君那里听说了。为了我的事要决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊，不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.21,0:20:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有栖)九十九
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.79,0:21:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.71,0:21:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}脑袋被打打坏了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行啊，不要再为了我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.49,0:21:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碍事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.67,0:21:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.93,0:21:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦…哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，挺有意思的嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是有栖！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个名字，给我刻在脑子里！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟我可是要成为你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}rival的男人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:21:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊 有意见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能有啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}莫名其妙！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.15,0:24:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.90,0:24:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
